    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d930">

                <pb facs="1115" n="1005" xml:id="pg1005"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.156/46: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Johnson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peiping</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-09-15T11:00:00+08:00">September 15, 1931—11
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received September 15—2:10 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>583. My 508, August 11, 6 p.m. Following from Cunningham:<anchor n="60"
                        xml:id="d930-f1"/>
                    <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“September 14, 4 p.m. My despatch No. 6925, June 8th enclosing foreshore
                                regulations.<anchor n="61" xml:id="d930-f2"/> Shanghai Municipal <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Gazette</hi> August 20 contains revised
                            foreshore regulations in nine articles only promulgated July 31. Revised
                            regulations draft for articles 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 11, 19 and 20 of former
                            regulations with minor modifications in those articles. Remaining
                            articles of former regulations omitted. Standard Oil Company has been
                            again approached to obtain foreshore permit fee.</p>
                        <p>Despatch follows.”<anchor n="62" xml:id="d930-f3"/></p>
                    </quote></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Johnson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d930-f1" n="60" xml:id="d930-f1-content">
